   "d": "2021-10-27",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Whilst the Board remains mindful of the external environment, including impediments in the supply chain and the possibility of higher returns of the increased stock ordered early, the strength of the first half performance means that we are confident in achieving market expectations for the year ending 28 February 2022.",
   "file": "20211027_BMY_Unaudited-Interim-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-01-26",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 3,
   "q": "Bloomsbury is pleased to announce that revenue is expected to be comfortably ahead and profit materially ahead of market expectations* for the year ending 28 February 2022.",
   "file": "20220126_BMY_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-03-30",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 3,
   "q": "Revenue is expected to be comfortably ahead and profit materially ahead of upgraded market expectations for the year ended 28 February 2022, surpassing the guidance provided in our statement on 26 January 2022*.",
   "file": "20220330_BMY_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
