   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Trading for 2023/24 has started in line with the Board's expectations and the Board is confident in its ability to achieve continued long-term success.",
   "file": "20230531_BMY_Audited-Preliminary-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-07-18",
   "doc": "AGM",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Bloomsbury's trading has been in line with expectations* following a good performance in the first four months of its financial year, with year-on-year sales growth of 9% maintaining the momentum from the prior year.",
